&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We&#39;re building the infrastructure that lets companies actually activate their data, not just store it. As the first Account Executive selling into Japan you&#39;ll help define how we bring Hightouch to a region where data infrastructure is evolving fast, and enterprises are hungry for modern solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
