&lt;p&gt;At Hightouch, our mission is to help our customers leverage data and AI to grow their businesses. The team is ambitious, impact-driven, efficient — and we believe humility, kindness, and compassion are essential to our success. If you&#39;re energized by velocity, obsessed with raising the bar, and want to build alongside people who care deeply about each other and our customers, we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly analytical and customer-obsessed &lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed Analytics Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to bridge the gap between our customers&#39; complex legacy reporting environments and the future of agentic data exploration. Sitting within the Solutions &amp;amp; Success organization, you will be the tip of the spear in helping our enterprise customers activate the full power of Hightouch’s Agentic CDP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your core mission is to deeply understand our customers&#39; existing marketing and BI reports, reverse-engineer their logic, and cleanly translate them into Hightouch. More importantly, you will architect and maintain the underlying context and semantic layers that power our chat-based reporting features. You will ensure that when a marketer asks our AI an ad-hoc reporting question, the system generates SQL that is not only accurate but highly reliable, idempotent, and perfectly aligned with the customer&#39;s unique business definitions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Scoping &amp;amp; Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope difficult reporting questions and clarify the core business decisions the resulting reports must support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Reporting &amp;amp; Translation:&lt;/strong&gt; Audit and deconstruct complex customer marketing reports across legacy BI tools. Build, implement, and translate these into complex reports, analyses, and reusable reporting frameworks within Hightouch’s aCDP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Data Investigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Rigorously investigate data sources, identity resolution logic, metric definitions, and audience behavior within the aCDP to ensure absolute accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Enablement &amp;amp; Training:&lt;/strong&gt; Train non-technical and non-AI forward marketers on how to use AI effectively to brainstorm and strategize, particularly when Ads and LCM Studio are not in-scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Explain your analytical findings in a clear, actionable way that helps our customers make critical business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context Layer Engineering &amp;amp; Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, build, and tune the semantic context layer. Rigorously document assumptions, data limitations, and recommended next steps for ongoing use, ensuring report generation maintains strict consistency and idempotency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep SQL Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; You write clean, performant, and scalable SQL. You are deeply comfortable navigating cloud data platforms, particularly Snowflake and Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BI &amp;amp; Marketing Analytics DNA:&lt;/strong&gt; You have extensive experience building or dissecting BI reports. You understand marketing schemas, attribution models, and what metrics actually matter to a growth team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand how to build robust semantic layers. You can take a messy, real-world database and organize it into a structured, highly contextualized format that an LLM can reliably query.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Facing Polish:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess the empathy and communication skills necessary to navigate complex technical discussions, train marketers, and deliver clear findings to both engineers and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Martech Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand the modern data stack and marketing technology infrastructure (CDPs, ETL/ELT pipelines, and data activation systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working with LLMs, prompt engineering, or AI-driven analytics tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in a Forward Deployed, Solutions Engineering, or Technical Customer Success role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with array aggregation and object manipulation in modern cloud data warehouses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Compensation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$100,000-$160,000 USD per year, location-independent. We also offer meaningful equity in the form of ISO options, with early exercise and a 10-year post-termination exercise window.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Verify Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hightouch participates in E-Verify. After you join the team, we&#39;ll verify your eligibility to work in the U.S. by submitting information from your Form I-9 to the Social Security Administration and, if needed, the Department of Homeland Security. This process happens post-hire only — we never use E-Verify to pre-screen applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rhoworld.com/wp-content/uploads/E-Verify_Participation_Poster-1.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;E-Verify Notice&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rhoworld.com/wp-content/uploads/E-Verify_Participation_Poster_ES-1.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;E-Verify Notice (Spanish)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rhoworld.com/wp-content/uploads/ier_poster_final.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Right to Work Notice&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rhoworld.com/wp-content/uploads/spanish_ier_poster_final.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Right to Work Notice (Spanish)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

