&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Growth Marketing Lead to build the revenue funnel for our new product: Ad Studio,&amp;nbsp; an AI-powered creative platform for performance marketing teams. It turns performance data, market trends, competitor activity, brand guidelines, and existing creative assets into on-brand ad concepts at scale. You’ll own the full growth marketing motion: paid ads, webinars, lead generation, and content that earns attention in the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re an expert performance marketer with an entrepreneurial spirit who wants to build a revenue engine for a breakout product at a hypergrowth startup, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and scale growth channels for Ad Studio: &lt;/strong&gt;Launch and optimize paid campaigns across LinkedIn, Meta, Google, and emerging channels. Ideate and create lead magnets to anchor the funnel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure everything: &lt;/strong&gt;Build reporting on funnel conversion, CPL, and pipeline. Use the data to make decisions on budget distribution and future testing plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Move like a founder: &lt;/strong&gt;Set your own roadmap, experiment often, and treat Ad Studio’s pipeline like it’s your own company’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance marketing expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;5+ years running paid acquisition and demand gen at a B2B SaaS company, with a proven record of driving pipeline and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founder mentality: &lt;/strong&gt;Your default is “I’ll go do it myself.” You’ve built programs from 0 → 1 and you’re energized by a blank slate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder instincts: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on with AI tools and curious to learn and build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong writing: &lt;/strong&gt;You can write a blog post that takes a stance and earns attention, and ad copy that stops the scroll.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical rigor: &lt;/strong&gt;Deep comfort with funnel metrics, attribution, and experiment design. Ability to tell a story through data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hypergrowth appetite: &lt;/strong&gt;You want the pace, ambiguity, and ownership that come with a breakout product at a fast-scaling startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus If You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing to marketers, or a background in adtech, martech, or creative tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior founder, founding marketer, or early-stage startup experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CDPs, data warehouses, or the modern data stack ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about building the revenue engine for an AI product that’s redefining how ads get made, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this position is $140,000 - $180,000 USD per year, which is location-independent in accordance with our remote-first policy. We also offer meaningful equity compensation in the form of ISO options and offer early exercise and a 10-year post-termination exercise window.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Verify Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
