&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this position is $91,000 – $102,000 per year (OTE $130,000 - $145,000), which is location-independent in accordance with our remote-first policy. We also offer meaningful equity compensation in the form of ISO options and offer early exercise and a 10-year post-termination exercise window.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Verify Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
