&lt;p&gt;At Hightouch, our mission is to help our customers leverage data and AI to grow their businesses. The team is ambitious, impact-driven, efficient — and we believe humility, kindness, and compassion are essential to our success. If you&#39;re energized by velocity, obsessed with raising the bar, and want to build alongside people who care deeply about each other and our customers, we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Hightouch is looking for a Sales Manager to build and lead the founding Ad Studio sales team. Ad Studio is one of our newest products and lets performance marketing teams build, edit, and launch on-brand ads at scale using AI, all backed by first-party data. This is a ground-floor opportunity to help define how we bring it to market and to build the team that does it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be the first sales leader dedicated to Ad Studio, which means you&#39;ll have real influence over the sales motion, the ICP, hiring, and how we position the product with customers. You&#39;re not inheriting a playbook, you&#39;re writing it and coaching your team to run it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The buyers your team sells to are performance marketers, paid social and paid search leads, creative strategists, and growth teams at mid-market companies who are constantly battling creative fatigue, slow production cycles, and rising CPMs. You&#39;ll help your reps show them how Ad Studio changes that equation. Adtech or martech sales leadership experience is a real advantage here. If you&#39;ve led teams selling into performance marketing buyers before, you know exactly what keeps them up at night, and you&#39;ll hit the ground running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;These are consultative, strategic deals where your team isn&#39;t just demoing a tool; they&#39;re helping customers rethink how they produce and launch creative. You&#39;ll need to coach reps to sell that way, not just hit activity numbers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;4+ years of full-cycle sales experience plus 2+ years of experience leading or coaching a sales team. We care less about years of experience and more about the impact and results of your work and your team&#39;s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Excitement about being part of a founding team and comfort with the ambiguity that comes with building a motion from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Background in adtech, martech, creative tools, or selling to performance marketing buyers is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Track record of hiring, developing, and retaining strong sales talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong coaching instincts, with the ability to get in the weeds on deals when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Intellectual curiosity, high ambition, and humility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to adapt in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Genuine interest in AI and how it&#39;s changing the way creative and performance teams work together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Enterprise Sales experience preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;On-Target Earnings: $350,000- 430,000 annually&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We also offer meaningful equity compensation in the form of ISO options, with early exercise and a 10-year post-termination exercise window.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Verify Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
