&lt;p&gt;The On-Target Earnings (OTE) offered for this position will depend on several factors, including the selected candidate&#39;s experience, interview performance, and final level. OTE is one component of Hightouch&#39;s competitive total rewards package. We also offer meaningful equity compensation in the form of ISO options, including early exercise and a generous 10-year post-termination exercise window.&lt;/p&gt;
